# Regenerable line-numbered INPUT windows (~450 MB total). git-lfs is unavailable on this host,
# so these bulky per-batch window files are not tracked. They rebuild deterministically from the
# tracked manifests (*_manifest.jsonl map unit_id -> doc_id + line offsets) plus the samplers
# (build_span_units.py / build_span_units_ext.py). The annotations + span_dataset.jsonl + manifests
# below ARE tracked, so the dataset is fully usable and reproducible without these.
SPAN/
SPAN_recover/
A_boundary/
B_betagate/
B_scale/
G_sections/
W_windows/

# transient loop/run cursors
SPAN_loop_state.json
SPAN_recover_paths.json

# frozen line-embedding cache (large, regenerable)
SPAN_emb/
SPAN_linemat.npz
SPAN_pline*.npz
SPAN_pred_dl.json
